From 604516d17035c646c4c4066f1834df8ad42c4e8c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:23:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Activity no longer offers to undo removing a receipt

The attachment undo handler accepted a delete event, answered "cannot be
restored" as a successful undo, and marked the removal undone while the
receipt stayed gone. Only "add" is registered as undoable now, so Activity
says it cannot be undone instead of offering a button that does nothing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016zXWwzys3K4XksLh3rrcKu
---
 src/domain/attachments.test.ts | 15 ++++++++++++++-
 src/domain/attachments.ts      | 14 +++++++-------
 2 files changed, 21 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/domain/attachments.test.ts b/src/domain/attachments.test.ts
index 873f3e1..2b36d9a 100644
--- a/src/domain/attachments.test.ts
+++ b/src/domain/attachments.test.ts
